I found the answer here: https://groups.google.com/forum/#!msg/shiny-discuss/KFvLL4D6BZc/mtwo5y0BFrQJ

I revised the for loop to this, and it worked like expected.

for (v in vars){
    local({
      my_v <- v
      observe({ print(paste0(my_v,': ',input[[my_v]])) })
    })

  }

